          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Display, analysis and comparison tool</span></span></p>\n<p>Apply relative values to different levels of blood \u0003flow in tissue. Video and images are available during surgery or for later analysis.<br>\n</p>\n",
